---
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import EmptyState from '../../components/EmptyState.astro';
import AirportCard from '../../components/AirportCard.astro';
import ArticleCard from '../../components/ArticleCard.astro';
import { topics } from '../../data/site';
import { airports } from '../../data/airports';
export function getStaticPaths(){ return topics.map(topic=>({params:{slug:topic.slug},props:{topic}})); }
const {topic:t}=Astro.props;
const brands=airports.filter(a=>a.categories.includes(t.slug)&&(a.referenceOffer||a.testStatus!=='unverified'));
const articles=(await getCollection('articles',a=>!a.data.draft && t.related.includes(a.data.slug)));
---
<Base title={`${t.headline}｜三毛导航`} description={t.intro} crumbs={[{name:'机场推荐',url:'/recommend/'},{name:t.name,url:`/recommend/${t.slug}/`}]}>
<div class="container"><header class="page-intro"><span class="eyebrow">FIND YOUR FIT / {t.name}</span><h1>{t.headline}</h1><p>{t.intro}</p></header><div class="page-body"><h2>先检查这三件事</h2><ol class="flow-steps">{t.checks.map(c=><li>{c}</li>)}</ol><div class="notice">下方按参考起价或线路标签关联品牌，不代表适合性或实测结论。使用前应自行确认当地要求及目标平台规则。</div><section class="section"><h2 class="gap-bottom">与这类需求相关的品牌</h2>{brands.length?<div class="airport-grid">{brands.map(a=><AirportCard airport={a}/>)}</div>:<EmptyState text={`暂未取得支持${t.name}结论的核验记录。请先用上面的清单了解选择标准，可前往品牌资料库查看已收录的参考参数。`}/>}</section><h2 class="gap-bottom">继续阅读</h2><div class="article-grid">{articles.map(a=><ArticleCard article={a}/>)}</div><div class="notice">比较依据见<a class="text-link" href={`/ranking/${t.ranking}/`}>相关排行榜方法</a>，已有候选时可以进入<a class="text-link" href="/compare/">横向比较工具</a>。</div></div></div>
</Base>
